      227.39
    ],
    "text": "be given a fair and patient hearing by the policeofficers attached to such police station.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      241.49,
      397.19,
      303.59
    ],
    "text": "(4) Any such Attorney-at-Law shall, onbehalf of the person being held in policecustody, be entitled to meet the officer incharge of the police station and ascertain fromsuch officer the following information:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      317.69,
      397.17,
      341.75
    ],
    "text": "(a)offence alleged to have beencommitted by such person;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      355.85,
      397.17,
      379.79
    ],
    "text": "(b)date, time and location of the arrestof such person;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      233.71,
      393.89,
      397.19,
      430.67
    ],
    "text": "(c)date, approximate time and place ofproducing such person before aMagistrate; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      444.65,
      397.19,
      494.15
    ],
    "text": "(d)any other information, the revealingof which would not adversely affectthe conduct of further investigationsand the interests of justice.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      508.13,
      397.17,
      532.19
    ],
    "text": "(5) Any such Attorney-at-Law shall beentitled to\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      546.29,
      397.17,
      595.67
    ],
    "text": "(a)make representations on behalf ofsuch person being held in policecustody, to the officer in charge ofthe police station;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      609.77,
      397.22,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(b)make an application to the officer incharge of the police station, seekingthe grant of bail for such person interms of section 6 of the Bail Act,No. 30 of 1997; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
