      238.29,
      203.45,
      401.87,
      239.99
    ],
    "text": "(c)have access to the person being heldin police custody, as provided for insubsections (6), (7), (8), (9) and (10).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
